@startuml UML服务类图
' ===== 校园二手交易系统 服务层与仓储类图（实验三实现） =====
' 学号：241220107  姓名：黄毅
' 说明：界面层只依赖 Application 容器，服务之间按依赖方向单向引用，
'       仓储与状态机是被服务层复用的两个基础设施。

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 26
skinparam ranksep 36
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFB
  BorderColor #4A5C6E
  ArrowColor #4A5C6E
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E8EEF4
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F6F8FA
  BorderColor #92A5B7
  FontColor #2F4256
  FontStyle bold
}
hide circle
hide empty members

package "campustrade/services 服务层" as P4 {
  class "Application（context.py）" as App {
    +store / journal / auth
    +items / audit / trade
    +moderation / stats
  }
  class ServiceBase {
    #store / #auth / #journal
    #actor(token): User
  }
  class AuthService {
    +register / login
    +authenticate(token): User
  }
  class ItemService {
    +createDraft / updateItem
    +submitAudit / offShelf
    +search(cond, sort): list
  }
  class AuditService {
    +pending(token): list
    +approve(token, id, ver)
    +reject(token, id, reason)
  }
  class TradeService {
    +reserve(token, id, reqId)
    +cancel / confirm / finish
    +autoFinishDue(now): list
  }
  class ModerationService {
    +submitReport(token, id, type)
    +handle(token, reportId, action)
  }
  class StatsService {
    +sellerSummary(token, ...)
    +siteSummary(token, ...)
  }
  class JournalService {
    +record(operator, action, ...)
    +query(actor, ...): list
    +notify / inbox(...)
  }
}

package "campustrade 基础设施" as P3 {
  class StateMachine <<utility>> {
    +canTransition(cur, next)
    +applyStatus(item, next)
  }
  class Store {
    -path: Path
    -lock: RLock
    +commit() / load()
  }
  class "Table~<K,T~>" as Table <<generic>> {
    +newId(): int
    +add / update / get / require
    +find(pred): list
  }
  class "security.py" as Password <<utility>> {
    +hashPassword(pwd): str
    +verifyPassword(pwd, stored)
  }
}

package "campustrade/cli 界面" as P5 {
  class Shell {
    -token: str
    +run()
  }
}

App --> AuthService
App --> ItemService
App --> AuditService
App --> TradeService
App --> ModerationService
App --> StatsService
App --> JournalService
App --> Store

AuthService -up-|> ServiceBase
ItemService -up-|> ServiceBase
AuditService -up-|> ServiceBase
TradeService -up-|> ServiceBase
ModerationService -up-|> ServiceBase
StatsService -up-|> ServiceBase

AuthService ..> JournalService : 记录登录
AuthService ..> Password
ItemService ..> StateMachine
ItemService ..> JournalService
TradeService ..> ItemService : 复用状态校验
AuditService ..> ItemService
ModerationService ..> ItemService : 复用下架校验
ServiceBase ..> Store
JournalService ..> Store
Store *-down- Table
Shell ..> App : 只依赖容器

note right of TradeService
  reserve() 在 store.lock 临界区内完成
  “幂等键查重 → 状态校验 → 唯一有效预约 → 建单”，
  并发预约至多一人成功。
end note

note right of StateMachine
  状态图的唯一实现：非法迁移抛 Conflict，
  服务层改状态一律经过 applyStatus。
end note

@enduml
